{{Quote|Permission granted to land on Platform 327.|Cloud car pilot, to Han Solo and the ''Millennium Falcon''|<ref name="Episode V" />}}
'''Platform 327''' was a landing platform in [[Cloud City]] on [[Bespin]]. The ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'' parked there after the [[Battle of Hoth]] when its crew, the friends of [[Luke Skywalker]], were fleeing [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader's]] pursuit and sought refuge with [[Landonis Balthazar Calrissian|Lando Calrissian]]. However, [[Boba Fett]] had intercepted the ''Falcon'' and Vader arrived ahead, ordering his men to deactivate the ship's [[hyperdrive]] during its maintenance.<ref name="Episode V" />

